  "众星 XQS 黑黄电动车 带货架护杠 裸车出": "众星 XQS black and yellow electric scooter with rack and crash bars — battery and registration plate not included",
  "众星 XQS 黑黄配色电动车，之前兼职送餐时用的，车很能扛，现在不做兼职了所以出。\n\n- 带后货架和前后护杠，放大箱子、驮东西很方便\n- 动力还行，刹车片刚换过，刹车灵敏，骑着顺手\n- 适配 60V 换电电池\n- 仪表、车壳齐全，结构完整\n\n注意：裸车出，不带电池和牌照，价格已经按裸车算了。脚踏板有磨损，车身有明显使用痕迹，介意的同学慎拍。\n\n适合自己有电池、或者想要一辆耐造的车拉东西的同学。二手物品看好再买，可以约时间到充电棚看车。": "众星 XQS electric scooter in black and yellow. I used it for part-time food delivery. It is sturdy, and I am selling it because I no longer do that job.\n\n- Rear cargo rack and front and rear crash bars; convenient for carrying a large box or other items.\n- Decent power. The brake pads were recently replaced, the brakes respond well, and it rides smoothly.\n- Compatible with 60V battery-swap batteries.\n- Instrument panel and body panels are all present; the structure is intact.\n\nPlease note: the vehicle is sold without a battery or registration plate. The price is for the vehicle only. The footboard is worn and the body has visible signs of use. Please consider this before buying.\n\nSuitable for students who already have a battery or need a sturdy vehicle for carrying things. Please inspect this used item before buying. We can arrange a time to view it at the charging shelter.",
  "白色车架配蓝色点缀的26寸山地自行车，三刀一体轮，白蓝色坐垫，带后挡泥板和支架。前后碟刹，多级变速。外观整体完好，适合校园通勤。": "26-inch mountain bike with a white frame and blue accents, integrated three-spoke wheels, a white and blue saddle, a rear mudguard and a kickstand. Front and rear disc brakes and multiple gears. Overall appearance is in good condition; suitable for getting around campus.",
